      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Running header in the inner margin: Domain Survey (Hansei ichiran-hyō), eighth fascicle — the officials-and-military fascicle — Ikusaka section. Provenance label, not data. It names Ikusaka even though most of this leaf carries the tail of the previous domain, Iwakitaira."
